Test Case Type:
Direct On-Us Eligibility Reconciliation

Test Case Long Description:
Validate that Direct On-Us Eligibility Checks reconcile to the sum of Direct On-Us Accepted, Referred and Declined outcomes for each application decision date.

Expected Results:
Direct On-Us Eligibility Checks should equal:
Direct On-Us Accepted
+ Direct On-Us Referred
+ Direct On-Us Declined.

There should be zero difference between the total Direct On-Us Eligibility volume and the sum of its three outcome buckets.

